  "scope": { "kind": "workingTree", "base": "HEAD" },
  "summary": "Primary actions move to the header so Use commit, Use range, and Start stay visible on tall screens. A commit list click only selects; the header confirms. End walkthrough sits under Next, not in the footer.",
